<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to abduct civilians and attack security forces across northern Nigeria, including the kidnapping of a Plateau university student, two visually impaired persons in Plateau, and 14 schoolchildren from a farm, while killing police officers in Borno, Plateau, Sokoto-Gusau and ambushing a convoy in Zamfara. Bandits also abducted mourners on the Benue highway, a husband and five others in Benue, and worshippers in Kaduna, and killed five police officers heading to a Zamfara APC primary. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOZG85U0dfcnMxMTFuUFF1czZwb1Nta1Z2R0lyWWFJX0s1clltTGpsSmh0SW1JTXV1Uzl3SHYxbGotRVVTZHdXSUlBLVk5RTZZZElpbTBGNjFWcVFpTC1lVEZkTVpPRTc4cXFiNXRrSFNfSnhyV3lBSVNzUmp0RmNKUGF4NDdVanJqaXg4cVdsZGNNMDZHZHZ6V3dfanZ6ZEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQONIBY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQOC0yUWRrQl9zWXRGUWVzUVpxb1N2UkNIX2lzaTVLV0ROOTYwdW1jSjQwSl9TVDlHLTd1azRfcUxFSWxTdV8wdFpWZHJMNjVXVXRDREI1RVI1TVhGTm9UUk1SVUJlVzBHNll2WlJoWjQ0SkxPQzJFTXdVQWlqQmdqNFR2b3hjTjhZTFFPM1F0NHNmREZDRlhkdk9Vbm9nMDhyd3o3MG42SnZkbjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNWDBOYVpKTjViazJKbFZDV1RxNHFoUlVqVUt3SDhWMllaMTRuTjBGT2FtTjI0SkNVQWtGY1B3MUp6Ylk4RWYxSldSN0sxcnBCVXhtX1d5NmNoZFBhOERTNGwwakdaU2ZIaVE5ZEIwRm5SQjJnUnJVMm5pV0pjOFBUeGZIUzA1NkszZEh